  "details": "Create a group public server with a custom tag.\n\nClose the instance.\n\nYou can never use that tag again for your server.\n\nExample tags my group has burned through before realizing what caused it:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6caf5200-70e1-46c2-b043-e3c4abe69e0f&instanceId=TGR~group(grp_37b712ce-59ee-4a05-8fbf-bf8c0137e910)~groupAccessType(public)~region(us)\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_6caf5200-70e1-46c2-b043-e3c4abe69e0f&instanceId=TGRMAIN~group(grp_37b712ce-59ee-4a05-8fbf-bf8c0137e910)~groupAccessType(public)~region(us)\n\nAnd various variations of the sort, seems that when closing a instance it doesnt fully clear it or something, we havent been able to use the \"TGR\" tag for months due to this issue.",
